          "title": "You'll want to know: إعلام",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "إعلام — iʿlām — \"the media; informing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تكلم الإعلام كثيرا عن الحادث. takallama al-iʿlām kathīran ʿan al-ḥādith. The media talked a lot about the accident."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "إعلام (iʿlām) is built on the native Arabic root ʿ-l-m (Lane), \"to know\", the root of ʿilm, knowledge. Iʿlām is the verbal noun of Form IV aʿlama, \"to let someone know\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
